Subject: vg rna: store edited transcript path steps as 16-byte records, not protobuf Mappings

Stage A opportunity 1. Replaces the protobuf Path inside EditedTranscriptPath
with a vector of {handle_t, uint32_t offset, uint32_t length} records. Node,
orientation, offset and match length are all that any consumer reads back,
and the construction phase was paying about 190 bytes per step for a Mapping
holding a Position and a single full-match Edit. Applies to HEAD 6ffdcb969
(src/transcriptome.hpp sha256 191ea83c..., src/transcriptome.cpp fc797fcf...).
Touches only src/transcriptome.hpp and src/transcriptome.cpp. See README.md.

